  @key-example @smoke
  Scenario: Tab title shows the note count on initial load
    Given the web app has 3 notes in its state
    When the web app loads
    Then the browser tab title should be "Notes (3)"

  # Why: FEAT-PO-001 — the empty state is an explicitly required rendering of the same format
  @key-example @smoke
  Scenario: Tab title shows zero notes on initial load
    Given the web app has 0 notes in its state
